  "content": "\n\n<div><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?style=for-the-badge&label=Loader&message= Fabric,Forge&color=a8320c\" alt=\"Требуется Fabric или Forge\"><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?style=for-the-badge&label=Versions&message=1.19.X,1.20.X&color=a8320c\" alt=\"1.19.X, 1.20.X\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Этот мод делает одну простую вещь. Блоки шиповника разлагаются, как листва.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/midnightlib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/388/582/64/64/637580663642837174.png\" alt=\"Требуется MidnightLib.\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a>\n<div>FABRIC — требуется <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/midnightlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">MidnightLib</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/statement\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/225/282/64/64/637039203275053228.png\" alt=\"Требуется Statement.\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a>\n<div>Требуется <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/statement\" rel=\"nofollow\">Statement</a></div>\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/dhyces\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/Patreon_logomark.svg\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.apexminecrafthosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d12939\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.apexminecrafthosting.com/img/theme/apex-hosting-mobile.png\" width=\"594\" height=\"100\"></a></p>",
